Package: eeganalysis
Title: EEG Package
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Christos", "Dalamarinis", , "dalamarinischristos@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph")),
    person("Robert", "Oostenveld", role = "cph",
           comment = "Author of the FieldTrip electrode position tables in inst/extdata/fieldtrip")
  )
Description: Tools for reading, preprocessing, and analyzing EEG data from BioSemi recordings. 
    Includes functions for reading .bdf files, filtering, referencing, artifact correction, 
    and feature extraction. Additional EEG-data formats will be added in the future.
